                                                "sense_id": "55d4a8af-b29e-38e5-8e98-168e8a81d55f",
                                                "text": "Phosphorus has long been considered a powerful stimulant. It acts upon the generative organism, it is recorded, in a manner to cause the most violent priapisms."
